# Personal things never go in the repository: your settings, the index, the
# files pulled or extracted from your copy of the game, community maps,
# caches and exports (all of these live in config.json, index.json, library/).
config.json
index.json
library/
.venv/
viewer/.godot/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
# A second guard against song, map and game files anywhere in the tree.
*.wav
*.ogg
*.egg
*.mp3
*.obb
*.zip
*.dat
bundle
*.png
*.jpg
!docs/*.png
